Z||000000||ferrari_momo||09-10-2001||10:36 PM||||still have this same problem on my 88GT with 3.4 engine.  could it be the injectors (using 3.4 injectors).  could it be the flywheel?  the machanic used some other year flywheel.  engine mounts and stuff is new.  is it normal for 3.4 in fiero to have vibrations?  thanks for the help.<BR>pat k. <A HREF="http://www.thefibersmith.com" TARGET=_blank>www.thefibersmith.com</A> <P>------------------<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||fiero56||09-10-2001||10:56 PM||||Sounds like you REALLY need to find a new machinest. This one must be re...<P>Sounds like he used an externally balanced f/w. 3.1L crank(used in 3.4L block) is neutrally balanced.||||reg||1
Z||000002||ferrari_momo||09-10-2001||11:29 PM||||thank u fiero56.  i think i have to let the machinic tear the car apart to get to the fly wheel.  <BR>pat <A HREF="http://www.thefibersmith.com" TARGET=_blank>www.thefibersmith.com</A> <P>------------------<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000003||Alex4mula||09-11-2001||08:18 AM||||My 3.4 runs like the 2.8, i.e. no abnormal vibration. I'm pretty sure your injectors has nothing to do with it unless they are clogged or one is not operating. Is it missfiring? At which RPM it vibrates? If fuel, spark and timing are correct then I would take it to your mechanic for diagnosis. He should easily be able to find the cause.||||reg||1
Z||000004||turbo86se||09-11-2001||12:52 PM||||I know this isn't exactly related, but my 88 coupe has started vibrating when accellerating moderatly from 40-45 mph. It started this when we installed the V6 and replaced the passenger side driveshaft. <P>Any thoughts or ideas? ||||reg||1
Z||000005||ferrari_momo||09-11-2001||05:08 PM||||i think drive shaft could be the problem on your car turbo.  mine does it when it idles.  but goes away when i rev the engine or actually driving the car.  it is bugging me.  i am going to check if all spark plugs work.  tried injector cleaners many times.  didn't work.  hope this is not major.  <BR>thanks for all your inputs.<BR>pat k <A HREF="http://www.thefibersmith.com" TARGET=_blank>www.thefibersmith.com</A> <P>------------------<BR>||||reg||1
